(1249, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Rachel calls to schedule a project meeting. When does Rachel want her colleague to arrive?\nRachel wants her colleague to arrive ____________.', 'Rachel: Hi Thomas, this is Rachel from logistics. Regarding our project kickoff, I know we originally mentioned nine o\'clock, but the boardroom is only booked until nine-fifteen. Could you please get here before 9.00 am, say around quarter to nine? That way we can set up our slides without rushing.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'b9c180c9-e523-440a-8520-7af5d5385c5a', 'set6'),
(1250, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Colin calls his friend to suggest ways of reaching the mountain resort. How do most tourists travel there?\nMost tourists travel to the resort by taking a ____________.', 'Colin: Hello Simon! If you\'re coming up to the alpine resort this weekend, you could rent a car, but driving up those narrow icy cliffs is pretty stressful. Almost all travelers take the express shuttle bus from the central station. It drops you right at the hotel entrance.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '210a80c0-2f57-4bb0-8228-bef7e3fe919b', 'set6'),
(1251, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Sarah leaves a voicemail about her nephew Liam. What does he drink every morning?\nIn the morning, Liam always drinks ____________.', 'Sarah: Hi Aunt Linda, just calling to give you an update about Liam. You asked about his breakfast habit. While he likes eggs occasionally, he refuses tea or juice and insists on drinking warm milk every single morning before heading off to nursery.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'd5dc65a4-4333-4aa7-bd75-142a0e9eb38b', 'set6'),
(1252, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Karen calls to announce a change to the department dinner. What day will the dinner take place?\nThe department dinner next week will take place on ____________.', 'Karen: Hey team, Karen here. Just a quick reminder about our department celebration dinner. We initially planned it for Wednesday, but the banquet hall was fully booked. So we\'ve shifted the reservation to Thursday evening at seven. See you all then!', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '0f31f0e4-0b91-4a5f-9934-8ec2f9c75fc4', 'set6'),
(1253, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Jason leaves his friend an audio message after the gym session. What did he misplace?\nJason misplaced his ____________.', 'Jason: Hey Maggie, I think I left something behind after our workout session today. I had my gym bag and car keys in hand, but when I got to my vehicle, I realized my smart watch was missing from my wrist. Did you happen to spot it near the lockers?', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'a1b8f890-499e-4937-b528-51c52ab73306', 'set6'),
(1254, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to two colleagues discussing their lunch plans. What do they decide to do?\nThe colleagues decide to ____________.', 'Colleague 1: Are you heading out to the food court for lunch? Colleague 2: Oh, it\'s pouring rain outside and the queues will be terrible. Why don\'t we just grab sandwiches at the cafe downstairs on the ground floor? Colleague 1: Good idea, that saves us braving the storm.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '56c455d6-4c06-4373-9b54-0375f2cfb891', 'set6'),
(1255, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a customer in an electronics store. What type of vacuum cleaner does she want to purchase?\nThe woman wants to purchase ____________.', 'Customer: Hello, I\'m looking for a new vacuum cleaner for my three-bedroom apartment. I don\'t want a heavy upright machine that strains my back, and robot vacuums miss the corners. I\'d like a lightweight cordless vacuum with strong suction and a long battery life, please.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '847c0fb7-f4ae-466f-9f21-76016303f6e2', 'set6'),
(1256, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a tenant talking about his new apartment. What does he plan to replace?\nHe is planning to replace the ____________.', 'Tenant: Overall, the new flat has great natural light and modern floorboards, but the previous owner put up these dark, heavy balcony blinds that block the skyline view completely. I\'m definitely taking them down this Saturday and replacing them with sheer curtains.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '2345a537-57a6-4831-aac9-4b6bbcda0ead', 'set6'),
(1257, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to the community radio broadcast. Whose award ceremony is taking place in August?\nThe person receiving an award in August is ____________.', 'Radio Announcer: Turning to regional community news, City Hall will host its annual civic honors banquet in August. The distinguished community leadership award this August will be presented to Professor Evans for his outstanding contribution to environmental education.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '4dc4707d-aa9d-406e-a7ca-f83394818c82', 'set6'),
(1258, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Fiona leaves a message for her driver. What time does she need the airport taxi?\nThe airport taxi should arrive at ____________.', 'Fiona: Hello, Prime Taxis? I have a booking for an airport drop-off this afternoon. My flight boarding time moved forward slightly, so instead of picking me up at four-fifteen, could the driver arrive at 3.15 pm sharp at my residence? Thank you.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '6190ea17-8a06-48bc-bc1d-170bb2447a22', 'set6'),
(1259, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Two nurses are discussing their work roster. Why is the hospital post challenging?\nThe most challenging aspect of the post is ____________.', 'Nurse 1: How are you finding the surgical ward? Nurse 2: The clinical team is wonderful, and the patient documentation is straightforward. But having to rotate through back-to-back night shifts is truly exhausting—it completely disrupts my sleep rhythm.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'd990f859-f99f-4c74-971d-429ab3575e36', 'set6'),
(1260, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to an announcement in a home improvement center. Which department features the biggest discounts this weekend?\nThis weekend, the highest discounts are on ____________.', 'Store Announcer: Welcome to Apex Home Center! This weekend only, take advantage of store-wide clearance prices. While power tools and paint supplies are ten percent off, our biggest reductions are on outdoor patio furniture, slashed by up to fifty percent!', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '5d17c3fb-4870-4362-89c6-40e1a38faf10', 'set6'),
(1261, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to the radio commercial for a new neighborhood market. Who is the market primarily designed for?\nThe new market is tailored for shoppers seeking ____________.', 'Commercial: Introducing Green Valley Market, open daily on Elm Street! If you\'re passionate about supporting local growers and serving wholesome organic local produce free from synthetic pesticides, visit our fresh farm stalls today!', NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '69d6504d-ea24-4638-ac1e-34c08d310943', 'set6'),
(1262, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Four people are talking about their daily commutes to work. Complete the sentences.', 'Speaker A: I take the express subway train right into the central station. It\'s crowded, but it bypasses morning traffic completely and takes exactly twenty minutes.\nSpeaker B: I cycle through the city park\'s dedicated bicycle paths. It\'s refreshing, energizing, and keeps me fit before work.\nSpeaker C: Three colleagues and I take turns driving each week in a carpool. Sharing fuel costs and chatting on the commute makes the trip enjoyable.\nSpeaker D: I drive my own car, but I leave home at six in the morning when the highway is totally quiet and empty.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', '6a4267c7-9791-4779-b8f3-dd954f22c8fc', 'set6'),
(1267, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to two people talking about working remotely from home versus working in a central office. Who expresses these opinions?', 'Man: Personally, I find that resolving intricate design challenges happens far faster when colleagues are seated in the same room. Face-to-face interaction avoids misunderstandings. However, I have to admit that avoiding a ninety-minute commute every day saves an enormous amount of mental fatigue.\nWoman: I agree completely about the commute—both of us clearly appreciate reclaiming personal time. But from an organizational standpoint, junior employees miss out on informal guidance and spontaneous mentoring when everyone works isolated from home. Still, modern video conferencing software makes day-to-day coordination remarkably seamless, so hybrid arrangements strike the right balance.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', '9dd4f6fe-9b97-4cb5-ba02-0e1b7689b42a', 'set6'),
(1272, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a travel reviewer on the radio talking about a self-guided hiking trip in the Scottish Highlands.', 'Reviewer: When I embarked on the five-day West Highland hiking trail, I expected a gradual trek. However, the physical demands varied considerably each day. Monday\'s gentle lakeside paths gave way to brutal, boulder-strewn mountain passes on Wednesday that tested even seasoned trekkers. In general, self-guided trekking is magnificent, but hikers severely underestimate how much navigational preparation is required. Relying solely on mobile GPS in deep glens with zero cell reception is a recipe for disaster; you must be proficient with a topographical map and magnetic compass.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', 'fa7eb51c-6d47-4ada-a794-2c6459b888cb', 'set6'),
(1275, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a commercial building engineer on the radio talking about energy management in modern eco-friendly offices.', 'Engineer: When businesses evaluate their energy consumption, they often focus on high-profile investments like rooftop solar arrays or triple-glazed windows. Yet in our audits, we find that automating climate control schedules yields the single greatest reduction in energy waste. Simply programming heating and cooling units to shut down automatically thirty minutes before offices empty cuts consumption dramatically. Regarding environmental certifications, many rating systems focus too heavily on symbolic gestures and costly paperwork rather than verifiable kilowatt reductions. Practical monitoring is what truly saves energy.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', 'd796f5cc-bd0b-4a1d-97db-816b8f37d93b', 'set6'),
(1263, 2, 'MCQ', 'a. Speaker A: ____', NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 'click', 'null', '6a4267c7-9791-4779-b8f3-dd954f22c8fc', 'set6'),
(1268, 2, 'MCQ', 'Face-to-face discussions resolve complex issues faster', NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 'click', 'null', '9dd4f6fe-9b97-4cb5-ba02-0e1b7689b42a', 'set6'),
(1273, 2, 'MCQ', 'What is the reviewer\'s opinion of the trail difficulty?', NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'fa7eb51c-6d47-4ada-a794-2c6459b888cb', 'set6'),
(1276, 2, 'MCQ', 'What does the engineer identify as the single most critical factor in reducing energy waste?', NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'd796f5cc-bd0b-4a1d-97db-816b8f37d93b', 'set6'),
(1264, 2, 'MCQ', 'b. Speaker B: ____', NULL, NULL, 1, 2, NULL, 'click', 'null', '6a4267c7-9791-4779-b8f3-dd954f22c8fc', 'set6');
