(1271, 2, 'MCQ', 'Virtual video tools have made team coordination highly effective', NULL, NULL, 1, 4, NULL, 'click', 'null', '9dd4f6fe-9b97-4cb5-ba02-0e1b7689b42a', 'set6'),
(1438, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Marcus calls his dental clinic. When does Marcus want his appointment?\nMarcus wants his dental checkup scheduled ____________.', 'Marcus: Good morning, this is Marcus Davies. I\'d like to book an appointment with Dr. Wright for a routine dental checkup this Thursday. I have a client briefing at eleven o\'clock, so I really need a slot before 10.30 am. Could you see if 9.45 am is open?', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '45042533-9952-4027-bb24-7e7a2e75c07d', 'set7'),
(1439, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Elena calls her sister about travelling to the coastal island. How do most islanders travel there?\nMost islanders travel to the island by taking the ____________.', 'Elena: Hi Clara! If you\'re coming over to the island for the weekend, don\'t bother looking for flights because the airstrip is closed for repairs. The vast majority of locals and visitors take the passenger ferry from the mainland pier. It\'s scenic, reliable, and runs every hour.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '9136ed59-43be-4e93-889d-3f2bc9265616', 'set7'),
(1440, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Paul leaves a message about his daughter Chloe. What does she eat every morning?\nIn the morning, Chloe usually eats ____________.', 'Paul: Hi Grandma, just calling with an update on Chloe. You asked what she likes to eat before school. She won\'t touch cereal or toast, but she happily finishes a warm bowl of oatmeal with honey every single morning.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '9a1044c1-5c27-40fb-9087-a1836ff4b305', 'set7'),
(1441, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Diana calls to change the date of her photography exhibition. What day will the opening night be?\nThe exhibition opening night will now be on ____________.', 'Diana: Hello gallery members, Diana speaking. Due to courier delays with our framed prints, our landscape photography exhibition opening cannot take place on Wednesday as planned. We\'ve rescheduled the official reception to Friday evening at 6.30 pm.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'd9a6afcc-0e59-4538-80c4-0e33859424b0', 'set7'),
(1442, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Gary leaves a voice note for his coworker after the client seminar. What did he leave behind?\nGary left behind his ____________.', 'Gary: Hi Arthur, it\'s Gary. I got home after our client presentation and realized I left my fountain pen on the boardroom table. It\'s a vintage black pen with silver trim given to me by my father. Could you check if it\'s still beside the projector?', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'ad4a5755-8d67-41cf-a6be-0797c25d73dd', 'set7'),
(1443, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to two friends discussing their weekend exercise. What do they decide to do?\nThe friends decide to ____________.', 'Friend 1: Should we head to the community sports center for a game of badminton? Friend 2: The courts are usually packed on Saturday mornings. Why don\'t we run around the lake instead? It\'s sunny and cool outside. Friend 1: Great idea, let\'s grab our running shoes.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '70ff8535-1517-4eda-a686-013e66c4b500', 'set7'),
(1444, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a shopper in a department store. What kind of coffee machine does he want to purchase?\nThe man wants to purchase ____________.', 'Customer: Hello, I\'m shopping for a coffee machine for my home kitchen. I\'m not interested in plastic pod capsules, and manual filters take too long before work. I\'m looking for a programmable espresso machine that grinds beans and foams milk automatically.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'af5cd7ea-39f5-4721-9911-47b94b9a9abb', 'set7'),
(1445, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a tenant discussing her rented cottage. What does she dislike about it?\nShe is going to take down the ____________.', 'Tenant: The stone cottage is lovely and structurally sound, but the previous occupants covered the living room walls with this hideous floral wallpaper that feels dark and outdated. I\'m planning to strip it down this weekend and paint the plaster white.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'e4bca715-6854-4cdf-819d-fa04874d199b', 'set7'),
(1446, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a radio bulletin. Whose charity benefit concert is taking place in September?\nThe musician performing the charity concert in September is ____________.', 'Radio Announcer: In entertainment news, the Philharmonic Pavilion will hold an international charity benefit concert in September. All proceeds will support youth music education, headlined by the celebrated classical cellist Clara Rossi.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '0acb71af-3b2b-4f27-aadd-2a588a3fe9e9', 'set7'),
(1447, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Beatrice calls the logistics courier. What time will her parcel be ready for collection?\nThe parcel will be ready for collection at ____________.', 'Beatrice: Hello, Courier Express? I have a package of architectural blueprints for collection at our design studio. Our print technician is finalizing the binding now, so the parcel will be ready for collection at 11.45 am. The driver can collect it from the front desk.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '9dadb853-f758-4093-9126-15e61e7050ce', 'set7'),
(1448, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Two colleagues are discussing an overseas assignment. Why is the posting difficult?\nThe most difficult part of the overseas assignment is ____________.', 'Colleague 1: Are you nervous about taking the regional project lead in Tokyo? Colleague 2: The cultural transition is exciting, but managing constant time-zone differences with our European head office will be grueling—having three-way calls at midnight is tough.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '63c59a7c-6e61-45b1-b0ed-25466bc3da71', 'set7'),
(1449, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to an announcement in a supermarket. Which section offers the best price cuts today?\nToday, the deepest discounts are in the ____________.', 'Supermarket Announcer: Attention shoppers! For the next two hours, take advantage of our weekend flash specials. While bakery items and milk are discounted by ten percent, our fresh seafood counter is offering an unprecedented thirty percent off wild Atlantic salmon!', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'fdc59774-61cf-49c0-b145-acb6e5c46b79', 'set7'),
(1450, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a radio commercial for a new fitness boutique. Who is the facility aimed at?\nThe new facility is aimed at people seeking ____________.', 'Radio Ad: Looking to improve posture, de-stress, and regain joint flexibility? Harmony Wellness Studio invites you to experience our low-impact mobility and yoga classes guided by certified movement therapists. Book your first session today!', NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'fc2497c0-e609-4de1-86f4-33850371b31f', 'set7'),
(1451, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Four people are talking about their personal fitness routines and exercise habits. Complete the sentences.', 'Speaker A: I wake up at five in the morning and head straight out for a brisk five-kilometer run before the rest of the neighborhood even wakes up.\nSpeaker B: I practice restorative yoga in my living room with soothing music. It calms my mind and relieves tension without straining my joints.\nSpeaker C: I train four afternoons a week with an intensive personal coach who pushes me through heavy strength circuits.\nSpeaker D: On Saturdays and Sundays, I play competitive five-a-side football with a local community league.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', 'a466fe0c-772a-4d72-ba87-98250b8b2654', 'set7'),
(1456, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to two people talking about shopping online versus buying in physical high-street stores. Who expresses these opinions?', 'Man: Online marketplaces are incredible for product discovery—you have access to an infinitely broader catalogue of goods than any shopping mall could stock. But returning a defective item by postal courier is tedious. In physical shops, returning an item is instant and straightforward.\nWoman: That catalogue advantage is indisputable, but you simply cannot judge fabric texture or shoe fit on a screen; brick-and-mortar shops let you inspect physical quality directly. Furthermore, browsing high-street stores with friends provides an enjoyable social atmosphere that shopping alone on a phone can never replicate.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', '95d38182-2460-4351-9b7e-86ba96b2c0dc', 'set7'),
(1461, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a culinary critic on the radio reviewing a newly opened organic farm-to-table restaurant.', 'Critic: The newly unveiled seasonal tasting menu at The Wild Thyme was a triumph. The balance of acidity, earthy forest herbs, and delicate wood-smoked trout demonstrated extraordinary culinary refinement without feeling heavy or pretentious. Turning to the wider restaurant landscape, while farm-to-table dining has popularized sustainable gastronomy, many suburban venues use the label purely for marketing without genuine local sourcing. Conscientious diners should look beyond promotional buzzwords and ask where ingredients actually come from.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', '9826ffa3-9f92-4e8e-8d6e-b27a51f1255c', 'set7'),
(1464, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a university career counselor on the radio talking about undergraduate corporate internship schemes.', 'Counselor: When undergraduates embark on corporate internships, they often expect to spend months mastering theoretical software. In truth, gaining exposure to realistic workplace problem-solving—collaborating under pressure, prioritizing ambiguous deadlines, and communicating across hierarchies—is the single most transformative takeaway. In modern graduate recruitment, employers value demonstrated adaptability far more than perfect academic transcripts. A candidate who can pivot when an unexpected crisis emerges will always stand out.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', '97379c50-13cd-43c6-9391-2b94fae2c024', 'set7'),
