(1627, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Cynthia calls to rearrange a client presentation. When does Cynthia want the team to assemble?\nCynthia wants the team to assemble ____________.', 'Cynthia: Good morning team, Cynthia speaking. Regarding our pitch presentation for the overseas delegation, our international clients have an early flight to catch. So rather than convening at two o\'clock, I need everyone in Conference Room B before 2.00 pm, preferably around one-thirty.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '6b89e644-8581-4ba5-a839-41872f79f04a', 'set8'),
(1628, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Simon calls his friend to explain how to get to the new tech campus. How do most employees commute there?\nMost employees commute to the campus by taking the ____________.', 'Simon: Hi Greg, if you\'re commuting to our new suburban innovation park tomorrow, don\'t drive on the motorway—the toll bridges are jammed. Over eighty percent of the workforce takes the electric monorail from the north transit hub. It stops right inside our lobby atrium.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '4b07b108-a1ee-4fb0-b772-0c6a85993b8a', 'set8'),
(1629, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Miriam leaves a message about her father Edward. What beverage does he drink every morning?\nIn the morning, Edward always drinks ____________.', 'Miriam: Hi Laura, just returning your call about Dad\'s morning routine while you\'re house-sitting. He enjoys reading the paper with a warm beverage, but he never touches tea or juice. He drinks a large mug of black filter coffee every morning without fail.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '3b0bf78c-ac08-4702-895a-3c25de8bc463', 'set8'),
(1630, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Vanessa calls to announce a shift in the corporate training workshop. What day will the workshop be held?\nThe corporate training workshop will now be held on ____________.', 'Vanessa: Attention all department leaders, Vanessa here. Due to unexpected maintenance work on our main lecture auditorium on Monday, our mandatory risk management workshop has been shifted to Tuesday at nine-thirty. Please inform your teams.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '56255950-79fb-46dd-99cc-25e7b448f7bc', 'set8'),
(1631, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Leo leaves a voicemail for the hotel concierge after checking out. What did he misplace in the room?\nLeo misplaced his ____________.', 'Leo: Hello, front desk? This is Leo Henderson from Room 408. I checked out two hours ago and arrived at the airport, only to find that my leather passport holder is missing from my coat. I think I left it inside the top desk drawer. Could security check immediately?', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '6cf021c2-2f4d-4378-9504-4272cc970251', 'set8'),
(1632, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to two colleagues deciding on their Friday evening outing. What do they choose to do?\nThe colleagues choose to ____________.', 'Colleague 1: Are you up for going to that contemporary gallery opening tonight? Colleague 2: To be honest, I\'ve had a mentally draining week and just want something lighthearted. How about catching that new comedy film at the downtown cinema? Colleague 1: That sounds perfect, let\'s get tickets.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'c5a569e8-c180-4546-a8a1-be7bbda996ed', 'set8'),
(1633, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a customer in an electronics boutique. What type of monitor does she want to purchase?\nThe customer wants to purchase ____________.', 'Customer: Hi, I\'m a graphic designer looking for a display upgrade for my home workstation. I do a lot of panoramic video editing, so standard dual screens have annoying middle borders. I want to buy an ultra-wide curved monitor with high color accuracy, please.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'ef3e74cc-f412-462f-8ca5-8fe193334414', 'set8'),
(1634, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a homeowner discussing his suburban backyard. What does he plan to remove?\nHe is planning to remove the ____________.', 'Homeowner: The garden has beautiful mature fruit trees, but the previous owner erected this massive decaying wooden deck that has begun rotting and attracting termites. I\'ve hired a contractor to tear it down and replace it with natural flagstone pavers.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'cbdc5cc2-01ce-46a9-adee-b219b2c329c1', 'set8'),
(1635, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a local council announcement. Whose retirement gala is taking place in October?\nThe person being honored at the retirement gala in October is ____________.', 'Radio Broadcast: In regional civic announcements, the County Administration has finalized arrangements for its autumn ceremonial banquet in October. The keynote gala will honor Chief Inspector Walsh upon his retirement after thirty-four years of distinguished public service.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '726dd5ae-8aa5-4106-af0e-904a1d96de49', 'set8'),
(1636, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Trevor calls the garage about his delivery van repair. What time will the vehicle be ready?\nThe delivery van will be ready for pickup at ____________.', 'Trevor: Hi Frank, Trevor calling from Westside Couriers. Regarding our delivery van that was brought in for brake relining, the head mechanic just phoned to confirm that all test diagnostics are clear and the vehicle will be ready for pickup at 3.45 pm today.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'ff1f446f-b24f-4196-b336-160147007846', 'set8'),
(1637, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Two engineers are discussing a remote construction project. Why is the job challenging?\nThe most challenging aspect of the construction project is ____________.', 'Engineer 1: How are the crews handling the desert solar installation? Engineer 2: The technical equipment is performing well, but hauling heavy machinery across unpaved roads and sand tracks is an operational nightmare—vehicles get bogged down almost daily.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'd38ea2ca-f594-4c3d-b564-401b4111402f', 'set8'),
(1638, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a store broadcast in an electronics superstore. Which department features the biggest price reductions this week?\nThis week, the steepest price reductions are on ____________.', 'Store Broadcast: Welcome to Circuit City! Don\'t miss our autumn clearance event happening across all departments. While headphones and laptops are ten percent off, our deepest discounts this week are on smart OLED televisions, marked down by an incredible forty percent!', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '19a83f9b-1b80-490a-a118-c0217cf5c17d', 'set8'),
(1639, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a radio announcement about a new commercial development. Who is the complex designed for?\nThe commercial complex is designed for businesses seeking ____________.', 'Commercial: Introducing Nexus Hub, the district\'s newest commercial development! Built specifically for emerging tech enterprises seeking flexible collaborative workspaces with high-speed fiber infrastructure, private meeting pods, and modular lease terms.', NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'e889479c-fc3e-4825-8fb2-b4ce2cf3896a', 'set8'),
(1640, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Four people are talking about how they spend their annual vacation leave. Complete the sentences.', 'Speaker A: I love historical architecture and culture, so every summer I book guided walking tours through ancient European capitals.\nSpeaker B: For my annual leave, I always rent a seaside cottage where I can listen to crashing waves, read books, and completely unwind.\nSpeaker C: I spend my vacations trekking solo through alpine wilderness, carrying my tent and climbing gear over remote mountain passes.\nSpeaker D: Every summer, I volunteer for three weeks on a sea turtle conservation reserve, monitoring nesting sites along coastal beaches.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', 'ed9943d0-e7ae-4e0d-ba82-7a3996ff7e85', 'set8');
