(1816, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Angela calls to coordinate an airport pickup. When does Angela want the driver to arrive?\nAngela wants the driver to arrive ____________.', 'Angela: Good afternoon, Apex Executive Limousines? This is Angela Watson. I have a reservation for an airport pickup at Terminal 3 this evening. My business flight lands at seven o\'clock, so I need the chauffeur waiting outside baggage claim before 6.45 pm. Please confirm when the vehicle is dispatched.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '73701949-7188-483a-875c-2f2da3d4c41f', 'set9'),
(1817, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Vincent calls his friend about getting to the coastal convention center. How do most conference attendees travel there?\nMost attendees travel to the convention center by taking the ____________.', 'Vincent: Hello Patrick! If you\'re heading to the international trade summit at the harbor center, don\'t hail a taxi—the coastal highway is undergoing road widening. The vast majority of conference delegates take the express light rail from Central Station. It glides past all the traffic and drops you directly at Hall 4.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '8dcb9f17-7284-47a9-97d7-9d1a5ad4fdff', 'set9'),
(1818, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Nora leaves a voicemail about her nephew Oliver. What cereal does he eat every morning?\nIn the morning, Oliver always eats ____________.', 'Nora: Hi Auntie May, just returning your message regarding Oliver\'s food preferences while he stays with you. For breakfast, he doesn\'t care for eggs or toast, but he expects a generous bowl of crispy corn flakes with cold milk every morning.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '81a7de9e-7153-4ffa-8bb8-106f09e43645', 'set9'),
(1819, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Melissa calls to notify members about the regional chamber meeting. What day will the meeting be held?\nThe regional chamber meeting will now be held on ____________.', 'Melissa: Good morning chamber members, Melissa speaking from the executive committee. Please note that due to an international summit booking at the civic hall on Wednesday, our monthly regional business breakfast has been rescheduled to Thursday at 8.00 am.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '20ed5943-255c-4d92-9475-4f2946201f4c', 'set9'),
(1820, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Felix leaves an audio note for his office manager after traveling. What did he misplace in the auditorium?\nFelix misplaced his ____________.', 'Felix: Hi Brenda, it\'s Felix from technical sales. I gave the keynote pitch in the main auditorium this morning, and I\'ve just realized I left my laptop charging cable plugged into the podium power strip. Could you ask the AV crew to hold it for me?', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'c03fdb14-e685-4939-9592-4e9ffcbac13d', 'set9'),
(1821, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to two colleagues discussing an after-work activity. What do they decide to do?\nThe colleagues decide to ____________.', 'Colleague 1: Do you feel like heading over to the bowling alley after work today? Colleague 2: The music in there is always so loud! Why don\'t we stroll through the new botanical greenhouse instead? It\'s warm, quiet, and the tropical orchid display just opened. Colleague 1: That sounds wonderful, let\'s go.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '28ec9757-4cf1-456f-b9ef-92abb5664769', 'set9'),
(1822, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a customer in an appliance store. What type of air purifier does she want to purchase?\nThe customer wants to purchase ____________.', 'Customer: Hello, I\'m shopping for an air purifier for my child\'s bedroom. She has severe dust allergies, so a simple carbon filter won\'t suffice. I\'m looking for a smart HEPA filter purifier with quiet sleep mode and automated air quality sensors.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '4bd11cf2-9f4a-4612-984a-3c9ffcced852', 'set9'),
(1823, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a homeowner discussing her kitchen renovation. What does she plan to replace?\nShe is planning to replace the ____________.', 'Homeowner: Overall, the kitchen layout is spacious and functional, but the previous homeowner installed these dark, unpolished ceramic wall tiles that make the cooking area look dingy. I\'m having a tiler strip them off next week and put up white subway tiles.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '1e45706c-9d75-48e7-b3bb-77932813921b', 'set9'),
(1824, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a community radio bulletin. Whose book launch ceremony is taking place in November?\nThe author launching a book in November is ____________.', 'Radio Announcer: Turning to local literary news, the City Arts Council will host a special book launch gala at the Central Library in November. Renowned investigative journalist Arthur Sterling will unveil his highly anticipated historical chronicle of regional shipping.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'e7f2b5a7-ba35-452e-ac8c-0ce9055eea0b', 'set9'),
(1825, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Pamela calls the delivery company about her office furniture shipment. What time will the truck arrive?\nThe delivery truck is scheduled to arrive at ____________.', 'Pamela: Hello, Metro Logistics? This is Pamela from Apex Legal. We were advised that our office boardroom chairs would be delivered this morning, but our courier tracker was updated. The logistics coordinator confirmed the delivery truck is scheduled to arrive at 1.45 pm today.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'ff5da0b2-9ee4-442d-bec5-9d272624bb5f', 'set9'),
(1826, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Two hotline operators are discussing their job responsibilities. Why is the position challenging?\nThe most challenging aspect of the hotline position is ____________.', 'Operator 1: How are you coping with the customer support desk? Operator 2: Most calls are pleasant, but managing angry callers during system outages is intensely stressful—it requires incredible patience when customers vent their frustration for ten minutes straight.', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'f0c37243-dd66-4077-a414-fc8be1e52ab5', 'set9'),
(1827, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to an in-store broadcast in an outdoor recreation shop. Which category features the best reductions this weekend?\nThis weekend, the deepest price reductions are on ____________.', 'Store Broadcast: Welcome to Alpine Sports! Don\'t miss our weekend wilderness sale. While thermal jackets and tents are marked down by twenty percent, our deepest price reductions this weekend are on waterproof hiking boots, slashed by up to fifty percent!', NULL, 3, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'c6208b26-2c72-44cb-974e-61e0f4250f1e', 'set9'),
(1828, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a radio commercial for a new neighborhood culinary boutique. Who is the shop designed for?\nThe new boutique is designed for customers seeking ____________.', 'Radio Commercial: Are you an enthusiastic home baker looking for premium stoneground French flours, organic vanilla pods, and specialty pastry molds? Visit Sweet Artistry, the neighborhood\'s newest boutique catering specifically to lovers of rare artisanal baking supplies.', NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '40e53bad-12dc-4f81-8a8a-8e316ae42166', 'set9'),
(1829, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Four people are talking about how they manage their household budgets and spending. Complete the sentences.', 'Speaker A: I track every single penny I spend. The moment I buy a coffee or pay a parking meter, I log it immediately into a budgeting app on my phone.\nSpeaker B: I divide my monthly earnings into physical cash envelopes labeled for groceries, entertainment, and utilities. Once an envelope is empty, I stop spending.\nSpeaker C: The day my paycheck arrives, forty percent is automatically transferred into long-term index funds and high-yield savings accounts before I can touch it.\nSpeaker D: I meticulously compare promotional flyers and discount vouchers across rival supermarket chains every weekend to purchase groceries at the lowest possible cost.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', '21be4a6d-bcb7-48ff-96bc-018e492c9e2e', 'set9'),
(1834, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to two people talking about electric vehicles (EVs) versus conventional petrol vehicles. Who expresses these opinions?', 'Man: The initial showroom sticker price on new electric vehicles is still undeniably prohibitive for the average working family. However, the sheer performance advantage—the instantaneous torque, seamless acceleration, and total absence of engine vibration—makes EVs distinctly superior to internal combustion cars.\nWoman: That performance is exhilarating, and plugging the car in at home overnight provides unparalleled daily convenience—no more smelly petrol stations! But we cannot ignore the highway infrastructure deficit: outside major cities, public fast-charging networks still require substantial expansion if road trips are to be stress-free.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', '3da582dd-29d6-408c-bf37-68976d42d241', 'set9'),
(1839, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to a technology columnist on the radio reviewing a modern smart-home security ecosystem.', 'Columnist: Setting up the Sentinel Smart Home security hub was a breath of fresh air. The dashboard layout on the mobile application was remarkably clear and responsive, enabling users to customize sensor triggers and stream high-definition video feeds without lag. Looking at the wider smart home market, however, consumer frustration is mounting over walled gardens. Interoperability between competing brand ecosystems remains frustratingly fractured; getting devices from different manufacturers to communicate reliably without custom bridging hubs is still far too complicated for mainstream buyers.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', 'baceff11-a2d5-49b0-a9af-9a0c615d953b', 'set9'),
(1842, 2, 'AUDIO_MCQ', 'Listen to an urban agro-ecologist on the radio discussing municipal rooftop farming and community gardens.', 'Agro-ecologist: When municipalities assess urban rooftop farms, they often focus on kilograms of produce harvested or stormwater runoff reduction. In my fieldwork, however, the most profound community benefit is fostering intergenerational social connections and neighborhood mental wellbeing—bringing retirees and schoolchildren together to nurture living plants transforms community cohesion. Conversely, when looking at high-tech commercial vertical farms, many venture-backed start-ups are discovering that high electricity and climate-control costs make growing staple crops economically unsustainable compared to traditional farming. Vertical technology works well for microgreens, but not for feeding cities.', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'prompt', 'null', '137976e9-b142-4345-8783-4e563bd84334', 'set9'),
(1830, 2, 'MCQ', 'a. Speaker A: ____', NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 'click', 'null', '21be4a6d-bcb7-48ff-96bc-018e492c9e2e', 'set9'),
(1835, 2, 'MCQ', 'Initial showroom purchase prices remain excessively high for average motorists', NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 'click', 'null', '3da582dd-29d6-408c-bf37-68976d42d241', 'set9'),
