(1301, 4, 'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING', 'a visitor policy guide\n\n', NULL, NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', '{"items": [{"text": "If you intend to invite external contractors to the facility, please follow these guidelines.", "order": 1}, {"text": "Before visitors can proceed past the main turnstiles, they must hold a valid host clearance slip.", "order": 2}, {"text": "You can complete this pre-registration form through the front desk portal before arrival.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Our automated kiosk will issue one of these visitor slips once host verification is confirmed.", "order": 4}, {"text": "Upon presenting government identification, your visitor will receive an official pass lanyard.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Please ensure the temporary badge is clearly pinned to your guest\'s jacket while inside the building.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "If you intend to invite external contractors to the facility, please follow these guidelines.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}', '6b1629ab-b226-4f21-9949-e82de4fcce2c', 'set6'),
(1302, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'The sentences below are from an introductory text. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '092ede03-fdb0-4f1e-9d61-7c0b8d86b581', 'set6'),
(1303, 4, 'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING', 'traditional leather crafting\n\n', NULL, NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', '{"items": [{"text": "In traditional leatherwork, artisans follow a disciplined procedure for preparing and saddle-stitching hides.", "order": 1}, {"text": "The craftsman begins by carefully inspecting full-grain hides to remove irregular surface blemishes.", "order": 2}, {"text": "Their selection of natural vegetable tannins is vital because chemical concentrations alter leather suppleness.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Novice leatherworkers must grasp how each tool angle and thread tension determine joint durability.", "order": 4}, {"text": "This heritage method enables makers to produce flexible, watertight seams that outlast machine stitching.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Students can practice these hand-grooving skills during seasonal masterclasses held in south Wales.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "In traditional leatherwork, artisans follow a disciplined procedure for preparing and saddle-stitching hides.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}', '092ede03-fdb0-4f1e-9d61-7c0b8d86b581', 'set6'),
(1304, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood magazine about their local facility. Read the four texts below. Match each person with one statement.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
(1305, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'the city\'s newly opened municipal sports and aquatic complex', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
(1306, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person A\n\nThe main setback in this facility is the severe lack of clear schedule signage. The few monitors they installed flicker constantly, leaving swimmers confused about open lane hours. This chaos intensifies during afternoon youth training sessions. I still commute here because the regional gym across the district is overpriced. Half of the spectator lockers are out of order, so the team should dismantle them and introduce digital self-service key racks instead.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
(1307, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person B\n\nMost of the changing room benches near the diving pool are damp, splintered, and worn. The leisure board should replace them with water-resistant composite benches and tighten the shaky stainless-steel grab bars as well. The hydrotherapy zone is maintained nicely, but the warning cards go missing all the time. Management needs an attendant stationed there full-time. Having four receptionists chatting casually behind the turnstiles is an irresponsible misuse of community staffing funds.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
(1308, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person C\n\nI find it quite frustrating to find my way through the interconnected corridors. The zone numbering makes little sense, and directional arrows are frequently covered by large promotional banners. Additionally, the lap pool is positioned directly adjacent to the boiler filtration pumps, which ought to operate with minimal noise. It is overwhelmingly loud whenever the secondary heating pumps activate. The walkways between courts are far too narrow, leaving zero room to stop and stretch without blocking traffic.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
(1309, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person D\n\nI have always appreciated having this sports hub available. Ever since my junior competitive swimming days, it served as an ideal venue to practice and gather workout metrics. I continue visiting thrice a week to utilize the Olympic lanes and check my digital lap telemetry. The pool water quality is superb, but the facility suffers from an acute lack of mechanical upkeep workers. I notice this every time chlorine metering sensors fail or the electronic timers trip. There is never a repair specialist on duty when technical breakdowns occur, which happens regularly.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
(1310, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'16\', \'Who thinks the sports complex requires a larger technical maintenance staff?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
(1311, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'17\', \'Who wants malfunctioning storage fixtures replaced with automated modern units?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
(1312, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'18\', \'Who thinks the corridor signs and directional floor markers need clearer arrangement?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b', 'set6'),
