(1492, 4, 'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING', 'artisanal coffee cultivation and processing\n\n', NULL, NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', '{"items": [{"text": "In artisanal coffee production, there is a delicate method of wet-fermenting hand-picked cherries.", "order": 1}, {"text": "The farmer begins by selectively picking only deep crimson cherries from highland shrubs.", "order": 2}, {"text": "Their choice of fermentation tanks is crucial because varying ambient temperatures alter enzyme activity.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Roasters must understand how drying times and moisture levels influence bean development.", "order": 4}, {"text": "This careful washing process allows producers to preserve bright acidity and floral notes in the bean.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Agronomy students can observe these wet-milling techniques during field clinics in central Colombia.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "In artisanal coffee production, there is a delicate method of wet-fermenting hand-picked cherries.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}', '6300c976-95fa-4c28-a1bc-7ceebd29501d', 'set7');
