(1493, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood magazine about their local facility. Read the four texts below. Match each person with one statement.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1494, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'the city\'s newly launched public bicycle-sharing program', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1495, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person A\n\nThe primary problem with this bike initiative is the lack of visible informational kiosks at busy stations. The existing digital maps are tiny, and riders spend minutes searching for nearby drop-off docks. The confusion gets intolerable during morning peak hours. I use the service regularly because cross-town bus fares are expensive. Several docking plazas have clusters of damaged, abandoned frames, so the agency should scrap them and install interactive touchscreen return terminals instead.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1496, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person B\n\nMost of the bike saddles and hand grips on the older commuter units are cracked and worn down. The operators should swap out those parts with weather-proof materials and tighten the wobbly handlebar brake levers too. The electric-assist cruisers are great to ride, but the safety instruction tags are continually missing. You need an attendant at terminal hubs to keep bikes aligned. Having four municipal marshals standing around the central plaza checking phones is an outright waste of public transit funding.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1497, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person C\n\nI find the lane layout and docking station numbering remarkably confusing. Station codes do not follow sequential street addresses, and road signage is often hidden by roadside construction hoardings. Moreover, the main docking station near the metro station is placed right beside the high-volume ventilation shafts, which are supposed to run quietly. The whirring noise is deafening when exhaust blowers cycle on. The access paths around the docks are too narrow, giving no room to stand or adjust helmets safely.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1498, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person D\n\nI have always supported urban cycling. Ever since my university days, bicycling has been my preferred method to collect environmental data and commute. I still ride these share-bikes daily to survey traffic patterns and test mobile commuter apps. The fleet coverage is fantastic, but there is an acute deficit of on-ground technicians. I encounter this whenever mechanical gear cables snap or digital dock locks freeze. There is never a repair mechanic around to service broken bikes, which fail on a regular basis.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1499, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'16\', \'Who emphasizes that the cycling scheme needs a larger team of on-site service mechanics?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1500, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'17\', \'Who wants derelict bike stands cleared away to make room for interactive digital terminals?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1501, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'18\', \'Who thinks the docking station codes and street-level directional signs are poorly arranged?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1502, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'19\', \'Who thinks the bike components and brake fixtures require physical renovation?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
(1503, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'20\', \'Who notes that docking stops are disturbed by excessively loud industrial ventilation?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86', 'set7'),
