(1681, 4, 'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING', 'lost-wax bronze casting\n\n', NULL, NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', '{"items": [{"text": "In traditional bronze sculpture, there is an intricate method of lost-wax casting practiced since antiquity.", "order": 1}, {"text": "The sculptor begins by modeling an original clay core coated with a pliable wax outer layer.", "order": 2}, {"text": "Their choice of refractory ceramic slurry is critical because weak mold shells fracture under intense heat.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Apprentice sculptors must comprehend how molten metal cooling rates and air venting systems interact.", "order": 4}, {"text": "This ancient technique enables artists to capture exquisite surface details impossible with stone carving.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Students can master these gating and chasing skills at specialized foundry studios in northern Italy.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "In traditional bronze sculpture, there is an intricate method of lost-wax casting practiced since antiquity.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}', 'db4f3b5a-10c2-425b-933c-3a5d72e0280d', 'set8'),
