(1684, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person A\n\nThe biggest drawback in this coworking space is the complete lack of room directory signage. The few electronic boards they set up are regularly frozen, leaving visiting clients wandering aimlessly looking for meeting suites. It becomes intolerable during investor demo days. I still rent a desk here because private office leases downtown are exorbitant. Half of the hot desks in the east wing are broken, so the operators should remove them and put in interactive touchscreen booking kiosks instead.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f', 'set8'),
(1685, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person B\n\nMost of the ergonomic desk chairs in the open study room are wobbly and deteriorating. The facility managers should swap them for sturdy commercial-grade furniture and repair the loose electrical power-strip housings as well. The podcast recording booth is designed well, but equipment usage manuals keep disappearing. Management needs a staff assistant stationed nearby. Having three desk clerks sitting idle by the lobby entrance playing mobile games is a poor allocation of member subscription funds.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f', 'set8'),
(1686, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person C\n\nI find it extremely difficult to find my way around this multi-floor hub. The suite numbering system is completely counter-intuitive, and directional placards are frequently hidden by promotional banners. In addition, the silent focus pod was constructed directly beneath the central air-chiller compressors, which were supposed to operate silently. The rumbling vibration is deafening when the climate compressors kick in. The corridors between collaborative cubicles are far too narrow, leaving no space to step aside and take phone calls.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f', 'set8'),
(1687, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person D\n\nI have always been fond of this enterprise facility. Ever since my start-up incubation days, it provided an exceptional venue to analyze market data and hold team workshops. I still drop in daily to review financial analytics and access high-speed research databases. The internet bandwidth is impressive, but there is a severe shortage of on-site IT technicians. I notice this whenever shared cloud printers fail or router hubs lose connectivity. There is never a repair engineer on site to fix hardware problems, which occur continually.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f', 'set8'),
(1688, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'16\', \'Who thinks the enterprise hub needs a dedicated on-site IT maintenance team?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f', 'set8'),
(1689, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'17\', \'Who recommends removing damaged desks to install automated digital reservation pods?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f', 'set8'),
