(1868, 4, 'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING', 'an employee expense reimbursement policy\n\n', NULL, NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', '{"items": [{"text": "If you intend to claim reimbursement for overseas business travel expenses, please observe this procedure.", "order": 1}, {"text": "Before you can receive any company reimbursement, you must submit a certified itemized claim sheet.", "order": 2}, {"text": "You can complete this expenditure claim via the online employee portal within thirty days of travel.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Our automated finance system will disburse approved funds once managerial approval is submitted.", "order": 4}, {"text": "Upon verifying submitted expense receipts, the audit officer will issue your payment confirmation code.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Please retain all itemized paper receipts securely in your audit envelope for twelve months.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "If you intend to claim reimbursement for overseas business travel expenses, please observe this procedure.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}', '9e42ed86-2ac5-4873-9321-0a74a5fba2a6', 'set9'),
(1869, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'The sentences below are from an introductory text. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '1061aba9-3196-4e69-b7dd-2a09f22b0fa2', 'set9'),
(1870, 4, 'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING', 'the restoration of classical oil paintings\n\n', NULL, NULL, 4, 0, NULL, 'click', '{"items": [{"text": "In classical art restoration, there is a painstaking protocol for stabilizing aged oil paintings.", "order": 1}, {"text": "The restorer begins by conducting multi-spectral infrared scans to map underlying canvas cracks.", "order": 2}, {"text": "Their selection of micro-cleansing agents is crucial because harsh chemical solvents dissolve original brushwork.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Apprentice conservators must understand how varying varnish solvents and pigment binders react.", "order": 4}, {"text": "This delicate technique allows specialists to remove oxidized surface grime without harming historical glaze layers.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Students can practice these inpainting skills under supervision in museum conservation laboratories in Vienna.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "In classical art restoration, there is a painstaking protocol for stabilizing aged oil paintings.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}', '1061aba9-3196-4e69-b7dd-2a09f22b0fa2', 'set9'),
(1871, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood magazine about their local facility. Read the four texts below. Match each person with one statement.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1872, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'the city\'s newly opened bus rapid transit (BRT) line', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1873, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person A\n\nThe glaring flaw along this new transit corridor is the complete lack of route schedule signs. The few electronic arrival displays are regularly blacked out, and passengers stand bewildered wondering when buses will arrive. This confusion peaks during early morning commuter hours. I still ride this route because private cab fares are absurdly high. Many station ticketing machines are completely out of order, so the council should remove them and install smart contactless tap-and-go pillars instead.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1874, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person B\n\nMost of the metal benches inside the bus shelters are rusty, broken, and uncomfortable. The transport authority should replace them with weather-proof benches and secure the wobbling handrails along the passenger platforms. The dedicated bus lanes are great, but the lane restriction signs get knocked down constantly. You need a transit marshal stationed at key junctions to keep cars out. Having three customer service agents standing together chatting at the terminus is an absolute waste of public transit staffing budget.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1875, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person C\n\nI find it really tricky to navigate the transfer stations on this new line. Station zone numbering is completely illogical, and platform markers are frequently hidden by advertising billboards. Furthermore, the central waiting platform was built right next to the diesel exhaust ventilation towers, which are supposed to run quietly. It is deafeningly noisy whenever the exhaust extraction blowers turn on. The boarding walkways are much too narrow, leaving no space to pause with a stroller without causing a bottleneck.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1876, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Person Person D\n\nI have always been a vocal proponent of this rapid transit corridor. Ever since my college years, public transit has been my main way to collect urban transit data and travel across town. I still ride it twice a week to survey passenger boarding patterns and test smart-card apps. The express travel speeds are outstanding, but there is an acute shortage of technical maintenance staff. I notice this every time platform smart gates fail or ticketing barcode scanners freeze. There is never a repair technician around to fix mechanical faults, which happen all the time.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1877, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'16\', \'Who believes the transit system requires a larger on-call technical repair team?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1878, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'17\', \'Who suggests removing defective ticket machines to install modern contactless pillars?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1879, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'18\', \'Who thinks the platform transfer codes and directional markers are poorly organized?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1880, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'19\', \'Who thinks the station seating and platform guardrails require replacement and repair?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1881, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'20\', \'Who notes that waiting platforms are affected by excessive noise from ventilation equipment?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1882, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'21\', \'Who encounters recurring technical faults with platform gate hardware and scanners?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1883, 4, 'MCQ', '(\'22\', \'Who utilizes the rapid transit line specifically to gather transportation research data?\')', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', '40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b', 'set9'),
(1884, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'Read the passage quickly. Choose a heading from the list for each numbered paragraph. There is one heading that you do not need. The first one is done for you.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
(1885, 4, 'QUESTION_FORM', 'The Discovery of the Terracotta Army', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'click', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
(1886, 4, 'MCQ', 'Paragraph 1:\n\nArchaeological authorities initially believed that the well site contained only a modest cache of ancient ceramics. Senior state historians argued that historical annals made no clear reference to an immense underground clay legion. However, field specialists noticed that fragments found at the site exhibited unprecedented craftsmanship, suggesting an elite imperial commission. Skeptics cautioned that launching a massive excavation over valuable farmland was premature. Field archaeologists maintained that exploratory trenching would reveal an unprecedented historical vault.', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
(1887, 4, 'MCQ', 'Paragraph 2:\n\nThe site required unprecedented structural protections before systematic excavation could commence. Giant steel hangar structures were engineered over open subterranean trenches to shield exposed clay figures from sun and rainfall. Heavy climate-control units were installed to manage humidity levels. The logistical operation was enormous, requiring fleets of specialized trucks to deliver conservation chemicals, structural steel trusses, lighting arrays, and specialized sandbags. The surrounding field station was supplied with extensive laboratory equipment and living quarters for hundreds of researchers.', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
(1888, 4, 'MCQ', 'Paragraph 3:\n\nA multidisciplinary excavation corps—comprising paleopathologists, metallurgists, skilled restorers, and master draftsmen—was assembled under national directive. Armed with dental picks, fine camel-hair brushes, precision calipers, and specialized adhesive solutions, they methodically pieced together thousands of shattered clay warriors and horses, documenting every fragment with photographic care.', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
(1889, 4, 'MCQ', 'Paragraph 4:\n\nExcavation teams painstakingly cleared four massive underground chambers spanning several square miles. Working through meters of compacted loess soil, they uncovered over eight thousand life-sized soldiers, along with hundred-strong cavalry units, bronze battle chariots, and genuine lethal weaponry. Remarkably, each warrior possessed completely individualized facial features, hairstyles, and armor details. Chemical analysis of weapons revealed that bronze swords retained their razor-sharp edges thanks to ancient chromium salt plating, defying centuries of burial.', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
(1890, 4, 'MCQ', 'Paragraph 5:\n\nThe unveiling of the Terracotta Army triggered intense academic debate throughout global historical circles. International antiquarians argued over whether Greek artisans might have influenced the naturalistic sculpting techniques of the Qin dynasty. Others questioned the exact labor models used to produce such unprecedented quantities of ceramic figures. Nonetheless, metallurgists verified that the weaponry reflected a highly standardized, mass-production assembly system, rewriting modern perceptions of ancient Qin industrial organization.', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
(1891, 4, 'MCQ', 'Paragraph 6:\n\nIn the decades following the initial discovery, successive teams of archaeologists have utilized non-destructive radar and satellite imagery to survey the broader imperial necropolis. Modern researchers have located untouched subterranean palaces and water channels using thermal sensors, while international television networks have produced award-winning documentaries profiling the unexcavated central tomb mound.', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
(1892, 4, 'MCQ', 'Paragraph 7:\n\nThe wonder of the Terracotta Army continues to captivate the global public. Exhibits of the clay soldiers have toured major world capitals, drawing millions of enthralled visitors. Today, the excavation site is protected as a UNESCO World Heritage Site, remaining one of China’s most revered cultural treasures and an enduring symbol of ancient civilization.', NULL, NULL, 2, 0, NULL, 'select', 'null', 'bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c', 'set9'),
